%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ffd20afc55e26974198aa9b1c0c0eedf, type: 3}
  m_Name: Scene4
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LevelSubtitleDialogueObject
  AudioClip:
  - AudioClip:
      nameClip: Ringnig
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 795f427c74947774bac40e00da08df91, type: 3}
      volume: 0.86
      pitch: 1.566
      maxvol: 0
      loop: 0
      type: 1
      state: 0
      isPlaying: 0
    DialogueText: (Ringing)
  - AudioClip:
      nameClip: 1
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a3c6938532a60da45a054710d52a7f3e, type: 3}
      volume: 1
      pitch: 1
      maxvol: 0
      loop: 0
      type: 1
      state: 0
      isPlaying: 0
    DialogueText: My superiors and myself have to say, you are something else. Managing
      to deliver for years now with no mistakes is quite commendable, you really
      becoming our company's starlight
  - AudioClip:
      nameClip: 2
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c85186c3739e65242a41e36d536c7cd7, type: 3}
      volume: 1
      pitch: 1
      maxvol: 0
      loop: 0
      type: 1
      state: 0
      isPlaying: 0
    DialogueText: So now I believe you are ready to deliver products to Planets that
      are our highest priority so this job is crucial to become a success.
  - AudioClip:
      nameClip: 3
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 66c5e26f075fc4547b6489f02bf8537b, type: 3}
      volume: 1
      pitch: 1
      maxvol: 0
      loop: 0
      type: 1
      state: 0
      isPlaying: 0
    DialogueText: This is the illustrious Tau Ceti System, one of the first systems
      our civilizations settled. This does not contain as many asteroids compared
      to the Fomalhaut system.
  - AudioClip:
      nameClip: 4
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6140fbcbbe5ad8c44891aab61c276439, type: 3}
      volume: 1
      pitch: 1
      maxvol: 0
      loop: 0
      type: 1
      state: 0
      isPlaying: 0
    DialogueText: However this time you will need to figure out how to not get the
      ship damaged. One  time one of our employees directed their ship into the Tau
      Ceti star, they thought it was a planet. Hahahahahahahaha.
  - AudioClip:
      nameClip: 5
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3f650e2ac48f4ec46a5a4dfff73a5ecc, type: 3}
      volume: 1
      pitch: 1
      maxvol: 0
      loop: 0
      type: 1
      state: 0
      isPlaying: 0
    DialogueText: But anyway I should not keep you any longer to deliver you.
  - AudioClip:
      nameClip: 6
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b3359477cdf33194f860c3550158da35, type: 3}
      volume: 1
      pitch: 1
      maxvol: 0
      loop: 0
      type: 1
      state: 0
      isPlaying: 0
    DialogueText: (crying in the background)
  - AudioClip:
      nameClip: 7
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3bbdfbb6042443d4ca7c3c053bf68252, type: 3}
      volume: 1
      pitch: 1
      maxvol: 0
      loop: 0
      type: 1
      state: 0
      isPlaying: 0
    DialogueText: It was a mistake. I thought the planet was yellow.
